# API documentation sync

When any of the following change, update **`docs/API.md`** in the **same change**:

- Flutter service calls to Supabase (Realtime streams, RPC params, table inserts/updates)
- Edge Function request/response payloads (`send-telegram-alert`, `telegram-webhook`, `delete-account`, …)
- Firmware `sendLiveUpdate()` JSON body, headers, URL, or cadence in `Project_1_draft_v3.ino`

Source field lists from the actual code (`LiveService`, `AlertService._escalate`, `FamilyService`, firmware sketch). Call out the `Prefer: return=minimal` → HTTP 204 gotcha if PATCH behaviour changes.
